        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "こんなところで眠るわけないでしょ。\r\n少し休んでいただけ。",
            "enText": "I wouldn't sleep somewhere like this. \nI was just resting.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 7181338766893116628,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "昨日は……星が、よく見えたから。\r\nまるで一緒に走っているみたいで、それで――",
            "enText": "Yesterday… I could see the stars \nso clearly. It was as if they were \nrunning alongside me, and…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -1608726752290941283,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "っ……とにかく、余計な心配は無用。\n私のことは、私が1番わかってるから……。",
            "enText": "Anyway, don't worry about me. \nI know myself best, so…",
